{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:00 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"消防救起男子證實不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/acb3ae706d4e42c4f2f2b6f520875205/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_08_27_42_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>今日（3日）早上7時46分，警方接獲途人報案，指在油麻地避風塘對開300米海面，發現有人飄浮，消防接報派出救援船到場，將一名年約50歲男子救起，惟經檢驗後，證實當場死亡。警方在其隨身黑色袋內檢獲藥物，現正調查其身份及其墮海原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"男子當場不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c75b6cb9e138117e117c018060b17c32/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_08_27_42_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防救起男子證實不治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5dcfc13685a9d7b05c5a5bc8134d99a1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_08_26_28_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6f0ecae1fdbf5469e9770eb307c2084f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_08_26_29_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在死者的黑色袋內檢獲藥物。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4268856a61a7173b3a7625385c76622d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_08_26_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/98b12bc1dca6cc1230d18fed60c9bde7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_08_27_42.jpeg\"/>\n<p>防止自殺求助熱線：</p>\n<p>「情緒通」精神健康支援熱線及WhatsApp：18111；網址：https://www.shallwetalk.hk/zh/<br/>香港撒瑪利亞防止自殺會： 2389 2222<br/>生命熱線： 2382 0000<br/>明愛向晴軒： 18288<br/>明愛財困壓力輔導熱線: 3161 0102<br/>社會福利署： 2343 2255<br/>撒瑪利亞會熱線(多種語言)： 2896 0000<br/>東華三院芷若園： 18281<br/>醫管局精神健康專線： 2466 7350<br/>青少年情緒健康網上支援服務「Open 噏」：https://www.openup.hk/service</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:22:15.334060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":417,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:19:02.593308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T01:19:02.593308+00:00","content_hash":"fc58536d8fed32eed8eae309a1edc59b5e1f162d1cce8ab06cd7d6668196f5a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"cont